WEBVTT

00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:05.990
<i>Everyone is searching for a new world</i>

00:00:05.990 --> 00:00:12.090
<i>to attain that overflowing dream.</i>

00:00:12.090 --> 00:00:17.660
<i>They all jump over the horizon,</i>

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:26.440
<i>regardless of what lies beyond.</i>

00:00:29.280 --> 00:00:34.180
<i>We've run,</i>

00:00:34.180 --> 00:00:36.650
<i>we've dived into hope,</i>

00:00:36.650 --> 00:00:39.520
<i>and forgotten only courage.</i>

00:00:39.520 --> 00:00:44.260
<i>And we've been swept away by the crowd</i>

00:00:44.260 --> 00:00:48.920
<i>only to lose something dear to us.</i>

00:00:52.230 --> 00:00:54.600
<i>I smile with a twisted face,</i>

00:00:54.600 --> 00:01:01.270
<i>and it was the best smile I could put on.</i>

00:01:02.540 --> 00:01:04.640
<i>The inside of my mask overflowed with tears</i>

00:01:04.640 --> 00:01:12.290
<i>so I covered my wet mask
with yet another mask.</i>

00:01:12.290 --> 00:01:17.190
<i>I continue to walk through
the flat battleground,</i>

00:01:17.190 --> 00:01:22.430
<i>and I struggle, unable to warp.</i>

00:01:22.430 --> 00:01:32.540
<i>The dream waits quietly on a cape far away.</i>

00:01:32.540 --> 00:01:37.280
<i>Even if I fumble around clumsily,</i>

00:01:37.280 --> 00:01:42.010
<i>I'm sure I'll still be
able to make it there.</i>

00:01:57.060 --> 00:01:59.690
Accident at the freight
train switch yard.

00:01:59.690 --> 00:02:03.220
All nearby units, head to
the scene immediately.

00:02:03.360 --> 00:02:05.660
-Wataya! Let's go!
-Right!

00:02:15.740 --> 00:02:18.110
<i>Narumi-san...</i>

00:02:18.110 --> 00:02:19.450
<i>Strange...</i>

00:02:19.450 --> 00:02:22.180
<i>Why are the police moving this quickly?</i>

00:02:30.260 --> 00:02:33.890
You're Assistant Inspector
Narumi's brother-in-law, yes?

00:02:35.260 --> 00:02:39.860
You shouldn't be here. Hurry back home.

00:02:47.970 --> 00:02:50.240
Ayumu?

00:02:50.240 --> 00:02:51.800
Assistant Inspector Narumi.

00:02:52.710 --> 00:02:54.540
Senior Superintendent Kanzaka!

00:02:59.990 --> 00:03:04.980
"The Sound of a Heart Breaking"

00:03:16.800 --> 00:03:19.640
Assistant Inspector. Here's some coffee.

00:03:19.640 --> 00:03:21.330
Thank you...

00:03:21.970 --> 00:03:25.210
Looks like this is gonna
be an all-nighter...

00:03:29.640 --> 00:03:31.540
This is outside your sphere of work.

00:03:31.540 --> 00:03:34.140
<i>Return to the station with Wataya-kun</i>

00:03:34.140 --> 00:03:37.010
and do the work you were given.

00:03:43.350 --> 00:03:46.350
<i>Why was Ayumu there?</i>

00:03:47.660 --> 00:03:50.530
It sure is strange, though...

00:03:50.530 --> 00:03:53.260
I heard from an officer working there

00:03:53.260 --> 00:03:57.600
that Kanzaka has personally
taken charge of the case.

00:03:57.600 --> 00:04:00.370
Why do you suppose he would do that?

00:04:11.550 --> 00:04:14.720
<i>Madoka didn't come home
last night either...</i>

00:04:14.720 --> 00:04:17.450
<i>You'd think she'd at least call to...</i>

00:04:17.450 --> 00:04:20.120
Good morning!

00:04:20.120 --> 00:04:21.460
<i>Say, Narumi-san.</i>

00:04:21.460 --> 00:04:23.890
Why would someone as important
as the senior superintendent

00:04:23.890 --> 00:04:25.560
show up there?

00:04:25.560 --> 00:04:27.460
This is a sudden discussion.

00:04:27.460 --> 00:04:28.800
That person yesterday,

00:04:28.800 --> 00:04:32.200
his name was Senior
Superintendent Kanzaka.

00:04:32.200 --> 00:04:36.010
You've already finished
checking up on him, I take it?

00:04:36.010 --> 00:04:40.880
Yeah, I tried, but the
security lock was too tight

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:43.080
for me to get in.

00:04:43.080 --> 00:04:46.350
So there are things not
even you can pursue?

00:04:47.280 --> 00:04:50.350
I couldn't yesterday
because I was too sleepy!

00:04:50.350 --> 00:04:53.520
But if I get serious...

00:04:55.760 --> 00:04:59.730
<i>For now, according to the
information I got from Wataya-san,</i>

00:04:59.730 --> 00:05:04.540
<i>Kanzaka is apparently
Madoka-san's direct superior.</i>

00:05:04.540 --> 00:05:06.870
Apparently she's mad that
she was recently removed

00:05:06.870 --> 00:05:08.840
from crime scene investigations,

00:05:08.840 --> 00:05:12.610
<i>and because of that, she yells
at Wataya-san every night</i>

00:05:12.610 --> 00:05:14.910
at a pub...

00:05:15.110 --> 00:05:17.550
Have you heard anything from her?

00:05:17.550 --> 00:05:18.880
<i>Narumi-san?</i>

00:05:24.660 --> 00:05:26.890
Why are you following me?!

00:05:26.890 --> 00:05:29.760
Shoo! Go away!

00:05:37.030 --> 00:05:40.030
He took my breakfast!

00:05:41.770 --> 00:05:45.210
<i>Rio-san? You're out of the hospital?</i>

00:05:45.980 --> 00:05:48.910
I'm back on the front lines,
ahead of schedule.

00:05:48.910 --> 00:05:51.580
I can't quietly sit around
anymore, given the situation...

00:05:51.580 --> 00:05:54.380
But you're not completely healed yet...

00:05:54.380 --> 00:05:56.280
Hey, Rio!

00:05:57.520 --> 00:05:58.610
Bye!

00:06:04.730 --> 00:06:06.200
<i>Ryoko-chan!</i>

00:06:06.200 --> 00:06:08.000
There, there.

00:06:08.000 --> 00:06:10.670
You're little every time I see you.

00:06:10.670 --> 00:06:13.300
Did you shrink some more
while in the hospital?

00:06:13.300 --> 00:06:17.110
I'll have you know I grew three
whole millimeters since last year!

00:06:17.110 --> 00:06:20.540
-My chest grew too!
-Alright, alright.

00:06:20.540 --> 00:06:22.150
Can't you get information on Kanzaka

00:06:22.150 --> 00:06:25.350
using your information network somehow?

00:06:25.350 --> 00:06:27.280
Is that a request?

00:06:27.280 --> 00:06:30.190
Yeah. I rely on you.

00:06:30.190 --> 00:06:32.220
In that case, I'll get serious!

00:06:32.220 --> 00:06:34.460
Leave it to me!

00:06:34.460 --> 00:06:39.200
I'll make full use of my
network to find out about him!

00:06:39.200 --> 00:06:41.390
-I'm counting on you.
-I'm being counted on!

00:06:44.230 --> 00:06:45.640
Don't worry.

00:06:45.640 --> 00:06:47.540
The preparations have been made.

00:06:47.940 --> 00:06:49.170
There are no problems.

00:06:49.170 --> 00:06:52.010
I will be taking the next step shortly.

00:06:53.410 --> 00:06:54.900
Thank you for your cooperation.

00:06:58.080 --> 00:07:06.220
Some social situations signify
simple stigmatic symptoms.

00:07:06.220 --> 00:07:11.330
Surely some socio-economic
strides symbolize...

00:07:11.330 --> 00:07:13.230
This is no good either...

00:07:13.230 --> 00:07:15.160
You there! What are you doing?!

00:07:16.270 --> 00:07:18.500
"Newspaper Office"

00:07:26.380 --> 00:07:29.780
This is so yummy!

00:07:29.780 --> 00:07:31.110
<i>Strange...</i>

00:07:31.110 --> 00:07:34.520
<i>Why does she keep stealing
my boxed lunches?</i>

00:07:34.520 --> 00:07:37.250
An empty stomach makes for a slow brain.

00:07:37.250 --> 00:07:39.260
For now I'll eat a lunch box

00:07:39.260 --> 00:07:41.630
and then give it another go!

00:07:41.630 --> 00:07:44.230
<i>She stole mine but still
eats another one!</i>

00:07:44.230 --> 00:07:47.160
Just you watch. I'll work really hard

00:07:47.160 --> 00:07:50.260
to make up for the boxed
lunches I've eaten!

00:07:51.070 --> 00:07:52.760
I humbly accept this!

00:07:57.410 --> 00:08:00.280
<i>Her information network pales
in comparison to the police's.</i>

00:08:00.280 --> 00:08:03.210
<i>It can't extract Kanzaka's personal data.</i>

00:08:03.880 --> 00:08:06.380
<i>The reason this series of incidents,
including last night's</i>

00:08:06.380 --> 00:08:10.620
<i>hasn't gone public is likely
because someone on the police force</i>

00:08:10.620 --> 00:08:14.090
<i>is involved with the Hunters
and covering them all up.</i>

00:08:14.090 --> 00:08:17.590
<i>And it would be someone
with a lot of authority -</i>

00:08:17.590 --> 00:08:20.360
<i>a high-ranking official, in other words!</i>

00:08:28.210 --> 00:08:30.970
Does that mean someone
siding with the Hunters

00:08:30.970 --> 00:08:32.410
is on the police force?

00:08:32.410 --> 00:08:33.210
Yes.

00:08:33.210 --> 00:08:36.550
So if the Hunters do eliminate
all the Blade Children,

00:08:36.550 --> 00:08:40.540
then the insider will
simply keep it quiet...

00:08:46.560 --> 00:08:48.560
That was delicious!

00:08:48.560 --> 00:08:50.360
With the power of a full stomach,

00:08:50.360 --> 00:08:53.090
I guess I'll settle
things in one fell swoop!

00:08:55.500 --> 00:08:57.130
See you after school.

00:09:12.520 --> 00:09:13.810
<i>Narumi-kun!</i>

00:09:15.590 --> 00:09:19.060
I was asked to give this to you.

00:09:19.060 --> 00:09:19.820
Bye!

00:09:29.600 --> 00:09:33.040
"I'll be waiting at the
switch yard at 4:00. - K"

00:09:34.400 --> 00:09:35.970
<i>Narumi-san!</i>

00:09:35.970 --> 00:09:38.980
Well, let's pick up where we left off!

00:09:38.980 --> 00:09:41.140
This time for sure I'll
find out the true identity

00:09:41.140 --> 00:09:43.750
of the wirepuller inside the police!

00:09:43.750 --> 00:09:45.910
Sorry, but something's come up.

00:09:46.550 --> 00:09:49.350
And it looks like we can
forget about Kanzaka.

00:09:49.350 --> 00:09:51.020
What's going on?

00:09:51.020 --> 00:09:53.890
What do you mean we can
forget about him now?

00:09:56.960 --> 00:09:58.390
<i>Narumi-san!</i>

00:10:14.850 --> 00:10:17.970
<i>Rutherford-sama. A message for you.</i>

00:10:21.590 --> 00:10:23.920
What do you mean we
can forget about him?!

00:10:23.920 --> 00:10:27.420
Are you throwing away all the
hard work I've done for you?!

00:10:27.420 --> 00:10:29.860
Do you toss girls out like trash?!

00:10:29.860 --> 00:10:31.930
Stop talking like I'm a bad guy.

00:10:31.930 --> 00:10:35.700
So what if I do? Who's the
one making me talk that way?!

00:10:35.700 --> 00:10:40.670
Alright. Check into Kanzaka
to your heart's content.

00:10:40.670 --> 00:10:44.440
Tomorrow I'll make a
boxed lunch just for you.

00:10:44.440 --> 00:10:46.180
-Really?
-Yeah.

00:10:46.180 --> 00:10:47.810
Yay!

00:10:47.810 --> 00:10:52.020
In that case, I look forward
to your boxed lunch tomorrow!

00:10:52.020 --> 00:10:52.950
Later!

00:10:57.020 --> 00:10:59.450
It'd be a pain to have
her come with me...

00:11:02.390 --> 00:11:05.060
There is but one reason
that I have asked you here.

00:11:05.060 --> 00:11:08.930
I've received an e-mail from
the Hunters calling us out.

00:11:08.930 --> 00:11:12.700
It says to come to the scene of
yesterday's incident at 5:00 p.m.

00:11:15.040 --> 00:11:16.630
Two more hours...

00:11:20.140 --> 00:11:26.280
<i>I'll call at 5:00.
I want to know your answer.</i>

00:11:28.590 --> 00:11:30.090
How about catching the Hunters

00:11:30.090 --> 00:11:33.580
and getting information about
the police insider from them?

00:11:34.190 --> 00:11:36.760
That might be a good way to
learn about the situation.

00:11:36.760 --> 00:11:39.200
Yeah. The question is how to get them...

00:11:39.200 --> 00:11:40.530
Meow!

00:11:41.930 --> 00:11:45.540
Hello, Bla-Chil!
Having a strategy meeting?

00:11:45.540 --> 00:11:46.540
Kanone?!

00:11:46.540 --> 00:11:48.740
<i>Kanone-kun! How did
you know we were here?</i>

00:11:48.740 --> 00:11:50.470
Intuition.

00:11:50.470 --> 00:11:53.240
And what does "Bla-Chil" mean?

00:11:53.240 --> 00:11:56.210
It's short for "Blade Children".

00:11:56.210 --> 00:11:58.700
Isn't it cuter that way?

00:12:00.880 --> 00:12:02.950
Guess not.

00:12:02.950 --> 00:12:05.460
It's strange for you to show up suddenly.

00:12:05.460 --> 00:12:07.260
Did something happen?

00:12:07.260 --> 00:12:10.760
I had intended to take a
leisurely sightseeing tour,

00:12:10.760 --> 00:12:13.030
but I can't now.

00:12:13.030 --> 00:12:15.800
I could no longer remain
silent as I watched

00:12:15.800 --> 00:12:17.300
the way you fight.

00:12:17.300 --> 00:12:22.200
As a friend, and as a
fellow Blade Child...

00:12:36.750 --> 00:12:39.820
You seem to be a little too involved.

00:12:39.820 --> 00:12:41.090
This never would have happened

00:12:41.090 --> 00:12:44.730
had you simply remained ignorant

00:12:44.730 --> 00:12:47.990
and kept your head down in
fear of your brother's shadow...

00:12:50.600 --> 00:12:52.100
What's your point?

00:12:52.100 --> 00:12:55.710
You have been marked as
someone who needs attention.

00:12:55.710 --> 00:12:59.010
As someone who will negatively influence

00:12:59.010 --> 00:13:01.200
the cursed Blade Children.

00:13:02.880 --> 00:13:04.540
Who exactly are you?

00:13:21.700 --> 00:13:23.070
Eyes...

00:13:23.070 --> 00:13:25.830
Why do you seek the light of illusion?

00:13:27.400 --> 00:13:30.070
Even if you turn your eyes
away from the darkness,

00:13:30.070 --> 00:13:33.240
the world we exist in will not change...

00:13:33.240 --> 00:13:36.580
But our path hasn't ended yet.

00:13:36.580 --> 00:13:40.280
You don't know which path to choose.

00:13:41.590 --> 00:13:44.950
Because you believe in
the illusion of hope...

00:13:46.660 --> 00:13:48.730
Do you intend to seek out
the light of illusion

00:13:48.730 --> 00:13:51.850
and continue wandering, Eyes?

00:13:53.660 --> 00:13:56.290
Do you intend to leave me behind?

00:14:04.110 --> 00:14:08.080
The Blade Children must not be
allowed to exist in this world.

00:14:08.080 --> 00:14:11.750
Their existence is cursed
and should be detested.

00:14:11.750 --> 00:14:14.420
They must be exterminated.

00:14:14.420 --> 00:14:17.680
We cannot afford to sacrifice any more.

00:14:18.360 --> 00:14:19.990
Enough of your self-advertisement.

00:14:19.990 --> 00:14:22.480
Why did you call me out here?

00:14:23.090 --> 00:14:25.860
You have become lost...

00:14:26.100 --> 00:14:28.730
I must take you away.

00:14:28.730 --> 00:14:33.430
Your fate will be the same as theirs,
depending on your reply.

00:14:34.000 --> 00:14:35.570
Withdraw from this all.

00:14:35.570 --> 00:14:37.670
If you'll promise never to get involved

00:14:37.670 --> 00:14:38.910
with the Blade Children again,

00:14:38.910 --> 00:14:41.810
I will let you return home.

00:14:41.810 --> 00:14:46.350
Otherwise, I will have
to remove you by force.

00:14:46.350 --> 00:14:49.750
You may wind up saddening
your sister-in-law

00:14:49.750 --> 00:14:51.350
depending on your decision.

00:14:53.420 --> 00:14:56.360
There is no reason for
you to be involved;

00:14:56.360 --> 00:14:59.430
you're not one of the Blade Children.

00:14:59.430 --> 00:15:02.370
Though it would seem the Blade Children

00:15:02.370 --> 00:15:06.030
consider you the key to their salvation.

00:15:07.200 --> 00:15:10.710
But you're nothing more
than a helpless child.

00:15:10.710 --> 00:15:12.440
Now matter how hard you try,

00:15:12.440 --> 00:15:15.550
you will never be Kiyotaka Narumi.

00:15:15.550 --> 00:15:18.980
Return with your sister-in-law

00:15:18.980 --> 00:15:21.080
to the world you should live in...

00:15:28.790 --> 00:15:31.490
Think back, Eyes.

00:15:34.000 --> 00:15:36.870
I gave you strength...

00:15:36.870 --> 00:15:39.600
The strength to lose to no one...

00:15:39.600 --> 00:15:41.830
The strength to survive...

00:15:42.410 --> 00:15:44.240
I haven't forgotten.

00:15:44.240 --> 00:15:46.740
Then why do you try to throw away

00:15:46.740 --> 00:15:49.210
the strength you've been given?!

00:15:49.210 --> 00:15:52.010
Why do you try to run from fighting?

00:15:54.450 --> 00:15:56.850
Why can't you understand me?

00:15:58.790 --> 00:16:01.310
I've guided you this entire time.

00:16:02.190 --> 00:16:03.750
Don't...

00:16:04.660 --> 00:16:06.720
Don't leave me all alone...

00:16:18.880 --> 00:16:20.210
Listen.

00:16:20.210 --> 00:16:23.580
Up until now, you've only
stayed on the defensive

00:16:23.580 --> 00:16:25.320
whenever the Hunters drew you out.

00:16:25.320 --> 00:16:28.080
But now it's our turn to fight back.

00:16:28.080 --> 00:16:30.550
So we pretend we were called out there

00:16:30.550 --> 00:16:32.620
and then defeat the Hunters' plan...

00:16:32.620 --> 00:16:34.560
<i>That's our Kanone-kun!</i>

00:16:34.560 --> 00:16:37.090
Are you sure we don't need
to contact Rutherford?

00:16:37.090 --> 00:16:41.100
Don't worry. I'll contact him myself.

00:16:41.100 --> 00:16:44.230
Alright then, we meet up at
the freight depot at 5:00.

00:16:45.070 --> 00:16:48.340
You were at the switch yard yesterday!

00:16:48.340 --> 00:16:50.970
Why are you always at
the scene of the crime?!

00:16:50.970 --> 00:16:52.640
Explain it to me!

00:16:54.310 --> 00:16:56.410
You still won't talk?!

00:16:56.410 --> 00:16:59.480
Why do you always act
like you know nothing

00:16:59.480 --> 00:17:01.850
and then stick your nose
into these incidents?!

00:17:01.850 --> 00:17:03.850
Why do you always act
like you know everything

00:17:03.850 --> 00:17:05.290
and then keep quiet?!

00:17:06.420 --> 00:17:08.050
Why?!

00:17:09.530 --> 00:17:13.490
<i>Why am I always the only
one left in the dark?</i>

00:17:15.100 --> 00:17:16.290
<i>Why?</i>

00:17:17.700 --> 00:17:21.240
Tell me! Why won't you say anything?!

00:17:21.240 --> 00:17:23.440
What are you trying to do?!

00:17:23.440 --> 00:17:26.570
Why won't you talk to me? Why?!

00:17:27.110 --> 00:17:30.670
Could you...leave it up to me?

00:17:32.080 --> 00:17:34.450
I don't want you to suffer...

00:17:34.450 --> 00:17:37.780
My brother, the Blade Children...

00:17:38.120 --> 00:17:41.220
I don't want to see you in pain.

00:17:41.220 --> 00:17:44.330
I'll take my brother's
place and protect you...

00:17:44.330 --> 00:17:47.960
What are you talking about?
This is all your fault.

00:17:47.960 --> 00:17:50.600
My life has been horrible
ever since you got involved.

00:17:50.600 --> 00:17:53.370
You butt in on things by yourself,

00:17:53.370 --> 00:17:56.210
which keeps me from doing anything!

00:17:56.210 --> 00:17:58.840
You're the one who's making me suffer!

00:17:58.840 --> 00:18:01.640
Stop getting in my way!

00:18:01.640 --> 00:18:03.410
You'll take your brother's place?

00:18:03.410 --> 00:18:06.650
Yeah right, you're just a kid!

00:18:06.650 --> 00:18:10.050
<i>You'll never be Kiyotaka-san!</i>

00:18:21.630 --> 00:18:25.330
<i>Yes...I'll never be my brother!</i>

00:18:51.230 --> 00:18:54.130
Eyes. I want to hear your answer.

00:18:54.130 --> 00:18:56.230
Which path will it be?

00:18:56.230 --> 00:18:59.300
Kanone, I already answered.

00:18:59.300 --> 00:19:02.170
I said I will not choose
the path of destruction...

00:19:02.170 --> 00:19:03.740
That's not what I mean.

00:19:03.740 --> 00:19:06.370
The question is which path
leads to destruction.

00:19:07.040 --> 00:19:08.950
The only thing before your eyes now

00:19:08.950 --> 00:19:11.250
is the light of illusion.

00:19:11.250 --> 00:19:13.950
Why do you insist on
calling it an illusion?

00:19:13.950 --> 00:19:16.090
You've lost sight of reality

00:19:16.090 --> 00:19:18.290
because you so earnestly seek redemption.

00:19:18.290 --> 00:19:21.060
<i>Ayumu-kun won't be able to save us.</i>

00:19:21.060 --> 00:19:23.330
The only ones who can save us...

00:19:23.330 --> 00:19:25.300
...are ourselves.

00:19:25.300 --> 00:19:26.860
Kanone...

00:19:26.860 --> 00:19:30.300
The path you speak of is
enshrouded in darkness.

00:19:30.300 --> 00:19:33.870
The absolute darkness
of far-reaching depths.

00:19:33.870 --> 00:19:39.210
I want to believe in Kiyotaka's
"happiness of those who believe"...

00:19:41.210 --> 00:19:44.410
Very well. Then I have no choice.

00:19:44.410 --> 00:19:46.480
This is the end.

00:19:46.480 --> 00:19:48.580
I'll show you reality.

00:19:49.590 --> 00:19:52.120
Go to the underground
sewage utility tunnel.

00:19:52.120 --> 00:19:56.180
There you will find the
Blade Children's "Hell".

00:20:33.200 --> 00:20:34.600
Do you want some?

00:20:36.200 --> 00:20:39.770
<i>Allow me to buy some for you, Madoka-san.</i>

00:20:39.770 --> 00:20:40.860
Who are you?

00:20:45.380 --> 00:20:47.370
Haven't I seen you before?!

00:20:47.880 --> 00:20:51.480
I'll buy the irises for you...

00:20:51.480 --> 00:20:53.810
In Kiyotaka Narumi's place.

00:20:56.250 --> 00:20:59.920
<i>Madoka-san...Come with me...</i>

00:21:00.720 --> 00:21:02.850
Come...

00:21:05.850 --> 00:21:11.560
<i>A sweet scent washes into my throat</i>

00:21:11.560 --> 00:21:18.260
<i>and my feelings continuously overflow...</i>

00:21:30.380 --> 00:21:36.420
<i>Don't look at me with that same gaze</i>

00:21:36.420 --> 00:21:42.060
<i>that's like you're following a soccer ball.</i>

00:21:42.060 --> 00:21:47.960
<i>I've already grown used to
my third year at the office,</i>

00:21:47.960 --> 00:21:54.540
<i>but did I lose something instead?</i>

00:21:54.540 --> 00:22:00.280
<i>Those days long ago when we
would talk about anything...</i>

00:22:00.280 --> 00:22:05.480
<i>We're finally old enough now</i>

00:22:05.480 --> 00:22:11.320
<i>to have those slightly awkward
discussions about love.</i>

00:22:11.320 --> 00:22:22.930
<i>A single day seems so long,
but a whole year ends so quickly.</i>

00:22:22.930 --> 00:22:28.700
<i>A whole year seems so short,</i>

00:22:28.700 --> 00:22:35.010
<i>but how well will I be able
to live the rest of my life?</i>

00:22:38.810 --> 00:22:40.740
Time for Hiyono's Useful News Report!

00:22:40.740 --> 00:22:42.750
The acorn tumbled down and down!

00:22:42.750 --> 00:22:43.950
Water lets ships float,

00:22:43.950 --> 00:22:45.620
but it also makes ships capsize.

00:22:45.620 --> 00:22:50.090
He is doubly wet who hides
himself under trees.

00:22:50.090 --> 00:22:52.290
<i>Next episode's highlight
is when Narumi-san</i>

00:22:52.290 --> 00:22:56.730
washes his hair in the rain and
uses the wind as a hair dryer!

00:22:56.730 --> 00:22:59.200
On the next Spiral: Bond of Reasoning...

00:22:59.200 --> 00:23:00.700
The Mask's Confession

00:23:00.700 --> 00:23:04.870
Birds return to their old nests,
but what about fish?

00:23:04.870 --> 00:23:07.200
That's all for today's Hiyono's Playhouse!
